                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First things first, i'm not good with writing reviews, so i'll make this brief. One of my few serious reviews.\nSuper Dungeon Master is a FREE game that (extremely obviously) is based off Dungeon Master. With new characters and levels, and made in RPG Maker (the good part is it's not just \"another rpg maker game\")\n\nPros:\n- An action-rpg despite being made on RPG Maker, which makes it way closer to the original Dungeon Master than what it would be if it were turn-based\n- A wide range of characters to select from\n- A nice amount of levels for a free game\n- Puzzles with just the right amount of difficulty (my opinion)\n- Despite having a total of 31 characters, each character has their own skills and items to use, and you can specify which the AI should favor\n- Has a nice soundtrack\n\nNeutral:\n- A lot of puzzles (if you like them like i do, then you'll enjoy this game)\n\nCons:\n- The combat part of the game is VERY EASY. I cannot explain how easy this game has been so far for me. I literally have 30 mini-altar potions which revive and fully heal every party member.\n- As can been seen by the above, the regular potions are too rare while the OP potions are extremely common\n- The AI is still in need of refining, my companions\n- Some characters are way too overpowered, which helps making the game even easier\n\nOverall, i recommend this game. Most of the cons are difficulty related, and if the dev fixes that, this game has a lot of potential.\n\nEDIT: Potion and combat balancing have been redone in recent updates",
